      "summaries": {
        "en": "Data-Science-For-Beginners is a comprehensive 10-week curriculum that makes data science accessible to newcomers by breaking down complex concepts into 20 manageable lessons. It teaches practical skills through hands-on Jupyter Notebook exercises, emphasizing real-world applications with Python libraries like pandas for data analysis and visualization. Learners can follow the structured weekly modules to build foundational knowledge, then apply these techniques to their own datasets or explore more advanced topics in the field.",
        "zh": "Data-Science-For-Beginners是一个为期10周的数据科学入门课程，通过20节精心设计的课程将复杂概念分解为易于掌握的知识点，帮助初学者系统建立数据科学基础。课程采用Jupyter Notebook实践教学，重点教授使用pandas等Python库进行数据分析和可视化的实用技能，强调真实场景应用。学习者可以按周完成模块化学习，掌握数据处理核心方法后，即可尝试分析自己的数据集或进一步探索机器学习等进阶方向，实现从理论到实践的平滑过渡。",
        "es": "Data-Science-For-Beginners is a comprehensive 10-week curriculum that makes data science accessible to newcomers by breaking down complex concepts into 20 manageable lessons. It teaches practical skills through hands-on Jupyter Notebook exercises, emphasizing real-world applications with Python libraries like pandas for data analysis and visualization. Learners can follow the structured weekly modules to build foundational knowledge, then apply these techniques to their own datasets or explore more advanced topics in the field.",
        "sections": {
