        "zh": "Compound Engineering Plugin 是一个基于 TypeScript 的官方插件，旨在扩展 Claude Code 的工程能力，通过模块化设计解决复杂开发流程的复用问题。其核心采用插件架构，允许开发者将大型工程任务分解为可组合的专用组件，并通过清晰的接口系统实现灵活编排。技术亮点在于提供了标准化的扩展机制，您可以创建自定义插件来封装特定工程模式，或将其集成到现有开发流水线中，从而自动化重复性编码任务并保持项目间的一致性，适合需要结构化工程实践的团队实验。",
        "es": "The Compound Engineering Plugin is a TypeScript-based tool that enhances Claude Code's capabilities by enabling modular, reusable engineering workflows. It introduces a plugin architecture that allows developers to compose complex tasks from smaller, specialized components through a clean interface system. You can extend its functionality by creating custom plugins for specific engineering patterns or integrate it into existing development pipelines to automate repetitive coding tasks and maintain consistency across projects.",
        "sections": {
