          "what": "The Compound Engineering Plugin is a TypeScript-based tool that enhances Claude Code's capabilities by enabling modular, reusable engineering workflows. It introduces a plugin architecture that allows developers to compose complex tasks from smaller, specialized components through a clean interface system. You can extend its functionality by creating custom plugins for specific engineering patterns or integrate it into existing development pipelines to automate repetitive coding tasks and maintain consistency across projects.",
