      "summaries": {
        "en": "Tambo is a Generative UI SDK for React that enables developers to build dynamic, AI-driven interfaces that adapt to user interactions in real-time. Its core innovation lies in combining React's component model with generative principles, allowing UI elements to be created and modified programmatically based on context. Developers can integrate it into existing React applications to create intelligent assistants, adaptive forms, or context-aware dashboards, making AI-powered interfaces more accessible and interactive.",
        "zh": "Tambo 是一个面向 React 的生成式 UI SDK，它让开发者能够构建动态、由 AI 驱动的界面，这些界面可以实时适应用户交互。其核心创新在于将 React 的组件模型与生成式原则相结合，使得 UI 元素能够根据上下文以编程方式创建和修改。通过将 Tambo 集成到现有 React 应用中，开发者可以轻松创建智能助手、自适应表单或情境感知仪表盘，从而降低 AI 驱动界面的开发门槛，提升交互体验。",
        "es": "Tambo is a Generative UI SDK for React that enables developers to build dynamic, AI-driven interfaces that adapt to user interactions in real-time. Its core innovation lies in combining React's component model with generative principles, allowing UI elements to be created and modified programmatically based on context. Developers can integrate it into existing React applications to create intelligent assistants, adaptive forms, or context-aware dashboards, making AI-powered interfaces more accessible and interactive.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "tambo stands out for agent, agents, and ai in real-world workflows.",
